o","Is that the bathroom?","Aquilo é o banheiro?"],["Maya","Yes, it is. I drink tea in the morning.","Sim, é. Eu bebo chá de manhã."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Contrações I’m, you’re, he’s, she’s, we’re, they’re","items":[{"label":"Contrações I’m, you’re, he’s, she’s, we’re, they’re","note":"As contrações **it’s, that’s, this is** são frequentes. **That’s** soa /ðæts/.","words":["it’s","that’s","this is","what’s"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Point near you: This is…","pt":"Aponte para algo perto.","model":"This is my phone."},{"q":"Point far from you: That is…","pt":"Aponte para algo longe.","model":"That is the door."},{"q":"Ask: What is that?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"What is that?"}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 4 sentences about your room with this / that.","model":"This is my bed. That is my desk. This lamp is new. That door is brown.","checklist":["Usei **this** (perto) e **that** (longe)","Usei **is** corretamente","Terminei cada frase com ponto"],"words":"4 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “now” mean?","opts":["hora, tempo","agora","minuto"],"ans":1,"why":"**now** = agora."},{"q":"What does “time” mean?","opts":["hora (60 minutos)","cama","hora, tempo"],"ans":2,"why":"**time** = hora, tempo."},{"q":"What does “hour” mean?","opts":["hora (60 minutos)","minuto","banheiro"],"ans":0,"why":"**hour** = hora (60 minutos)."},{"q":"What does “minute” mean?","opts":["cama","minuto","agora"],"ans":1,"why":"**minute** = minuto."},{"q":"Something far from you:","opts":["this","that","these"],"ans":1,"why":"longe: that."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["No **Reading**, **this** e **that** apontam para algo que acabou de aparecer: procure o substantivo antes.","No **Speaking**, d